# Source material that gets dropped into the project root on its way to
# assets/img/. These are working files, not part of the site — keep them out
# of the repo so a stray `git add -A` can't sweep megabytes of phone photos
# into a commit.
#
# Patterns are anchored with a leading slash so they only match the root.
# Nothing here affects assets/img/, which is where the site's real images live.

/IMG_*
/WhatsApp*
/FreeSample-Vectorizer-io-*
/image-*.webp
/*.psd
/*.ai
/*.indd

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
